        },
        {
            "id": "698130112",
            "speaker": "Qiqi",
            "text": "Yes!",
            "choices": [
                {
                    "id": "698130113",
                    "text": "Well, something smells good.",
                    "response": [
                        {
                            "id": "698130115",
                            "speaker": "Qiqi",
                            "text": "#{NICKNAME}! I... borrowed this kitchen from Chef Mao... I wanted to cook something."
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "698130116",
                            "speaker": "Qiqi",
                            "text": "But I can't taste, so Chef Mao asked Guoba to help."
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "698130117",
                            "speaker": "Guoba",
                            "text": "♪~"
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "698130118",
                            "speaker": "Qiqi",
                            "text": "Eh? Wait... Why am I cooking? Let me check my notes..."
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "698130119",
                            "speaker": "Qiqi",
                            "text": "Oh! The notebook says: Make a dish and freeze it to prepare for the excursion with Yaoyao."
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "698130120",
                            "speaker": "Qiqi",
                            "text": "Mmm. I don't need to eat, but Yaoyao... needs to eat to grow... and get taller."
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "698130121",
                            "speaker": "Qiqi",
                            "text": "Will Yaoyao... grow taller than Dr. Baizhu one day?"
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "698130122",
                            "speaker": "Guoba",
                            "text": "?"
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "698130123",
                            "speaker": "Player",
                            "text": "That might be a tall order."
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "698130124",
                            "speaker": "Qiqi",
                            "text": "Don't worry. Yaoyao will be cute, no matter how tall she is."
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "698130125",
                            "speaker": "Qiqi",
                            "text": "Ah! We talked too long. The stove..."
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "698130126",
                            "speaker": "Guoba",
                            "text": "♬"
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "698130127",
                            "speaker": "Qiqi",
                            "text": "Thanks for watching the stove, Guoba. Please... try this last one as well..."
                        },
                        {
